# The levee: built up on its own bank, the river below on the right.
ramp 160 565 20
# The breach: one pad, a lip on the near side, and the gap the river broke
# through, deep on every lap. A kart that comes down in it is pulled out on
# the far side.
pad 296 centre 8
jump 346 1.8 12 boost
flood 350 402 -4.5 -4.5 -4.5 dip 6.5

# The cane: on the inside of the blind bends, a wall of cane a kart can
# slice through, a little slower, and see round next lap.
smash 640 right 8.5 cane 7
smash 700 right 8.5 cane 7
smash 815 left 8.5 cane 7
smash 840 left 8.5 cane 7

# The boardwalks: cypress planks with no rail, over shallow water. Fall
